From 8df75937b9bf28f9f41cb215e85b13faa33fd4bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Elara <elara@portal.local>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:21:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ui: sort and delay beside the mode switch, arrows on the
 group strip, no filters in the simple mode

The two list controls belong to the mode row, not to the list header. The group strip
scrolls with arrows because dragging chips while the list scrolls under the thumb is
fiddly, and in the simple mode there is nothing to filter: one portal takes all traffic,
so the strip disappears entirely.
---
